flowchart TD
  A[Valid claim data] --> B{Claim type}
  B -->|Car| C[Start risk score at 20]
  B -->|Health| D[Start risk score at 18]
  C --> C1[Check claim to premium ratio]
  C1 --> C2[Check incident time and police report]
  C2 --> C3[Check tenure and claim amount]
  C3 --> C4[Check severity and injury amount]
  C4 --> C5[Check witnesses and police report]
  D --> D1[Check loss date after policy inception]
  D1 --> D2[Check claim to premium ratio]
  D2 --> D3[Check risk segmentation]
  D3 --> D4[Check mild severity and claim amount]
  C5 --> E[Round and clamp percentage-style score]
  D4 --> E
  E --> F{Score at least 65?}
  F -->|Yes| H[HIGH]
  F -->|No| G{Score at least 35?}
  G -->|Yes| I[MEDIUM]
  G -->|No| J[LOW]
  H --> K[Return baseline result and triggered factors]
  I --> K
  J --> K
  K --> L{Gemini key configured?}
  L -->|Yes| M[Optional text enrichment; does not change score]
  L -->|No| N[Baseline result only]
